  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to National Agenc for Public Registry Georgia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to National Agency for Public Registry Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra statlig f&#xF6;rvaltning genom att st&#xF6;dja och bygga kapacitet av National Agency for Public Registry (NAPR). NAPR ansvarar f&#xF6;r att skapa, uppr&#xE4;tth&#xE5;lla och utveckla fastighetsregistrering, geodesi och kartografi samt f&#xF6;rs&#xE4;kra tillg&#xE4;ngligheten av information till relevanta parter.

Insatsen kommer att bidra till att &#xF6;ka f&#xF6;rtroende och tillg&#xE4;nglighet till fastighetsinformation samt f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra kvaliten p&#xE5; dess tj&#xE4;nster till allm&#xE4;nheten och andra intresserade parter. Insatsen kommer att bidra till att utveckla mark- och fastighetsf&#xF6;rvaltningen i landet - en viktig grund f&#xF6;r en stabil ekonomisk utveckling, ett starkt demokratisk samh&#xE4;lle med minskad fattigdom och lika r&#xE4;ttigheter f&#xF6;r alla.

Insatsen kommer att genomf&#xF6;ras av Lantm&#xE4;teriet under 2015-2018 med en volym p&#xE5; 35 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims at improvement of public administration through supporting and building capacity of the National Agency for Public Registry (NAPR), the authority that is responsible for the establishment, maintenance and development of the number of registries, geodesy, cartography and spatial data as well as ensuring availability information for relevant stakeholders. The intervention will be implemented by Lantm&#xE4;teriet, Swedish sister organisation to NAPR.

The intervention will enhance reliability and availability of land and other property information and will improve related services to the citizens and other interested parties. As a result it will contribute to well-developed land and property sector that is a base for growing stable economic development and strong democratic society with reduced poverty and equal rights and conditions for all.

The intervention has a volume of 35 000 000 SEK and will be implemented over 2015-2018.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall project goal is defined as: A national property market based on the continuous working, valid and reliable land and property system with equal prerequisites for all women and men anyone anywhere in Georgia.
Towards this overall goal achievement there are three objectives to which the project will contribute are defined as:
- Strengthen public administration providing reliable and available land and property information and related services.
- A well-developed land and property sector providing the basis for an economic development giving a stronger democratic society with reduced poverty and equal rights and conditions for all.&#xA0;
- A positive climate impact through supporting the implementation of the EU-directive INSPIRE, which is an important step towards enhanced EU integration.</narrative>
  </description>
